Subject: [PATCH 338/404] Unified: Motion to Video takes the 3D view as it is
 on the screen

The pictures were drawn again (saveImage): the view's section (clipping)
was lost, parts were seen through and the framing differed; the panel,
open while recording, narrowed the view; all the joints came back visible.
The panel closes first, the pick's highlight and the joints' markers are
put away (only those that were shown come back), and each picture is the
3D view's framebuffer. The progress is on the status bar.
(engine field test 0.7.6)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
